			"notes": "# Added configs\nCheck out the [wiki](https://github.com/Ezzocorbi/bob-fluid-translator/wiki/Configs) page about configs\n\nSummary: with the new system you can\n- exclude NTM fluids from receiving a Forge fluid counterpart\n- specify custom mappings for fluids (useful to enhance compatibility with other mods)\n- break your world with a typo in the config file \n\n_!!! Please make a backup of your world if you edit the config file !!!_\n\n# Fixes\n- fixed many crashes by updating to NTM X5572\n- fixed crash when the mod is unable to find the asset for a fluid\n- fixed bug where NTM adapter would reset the selected tank on neighbor update"
		},
